  - match: "(?x) \\b\n((0(x|X)[0-9a-fA-F]*)\n|(\n  ([0-9]+\\.?[0-9]*)\n  |(\\.[0-9]+)\n )((e|E)(\\+|-)?[0-9]+)?\n)\\b\n"
